---
import DocsNav from "../components/DocsNav.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { evidenceRows, metrics, repositoryUrl } from "../data/site";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Evidence | OrbitKV"
  description="Append-only OrbitKV correctness, lifecycle, memory, and performance-smoke evidence with explicit source boundaries."
  active="Evidence"
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Evidence</p>
    <h1>Each result keeps its boundary.</h1>
    <p>
      A result fixes source, GPU, workload, method, and excluded claims.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="docs-layout">
    <DocsNav active="Evidence" />
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Live host gates and sealed ABI8 Prefix boundary</h2>
      <div class="metric-grid compact">
        {metrics.map((item) => (
          <article><strong>{item.value}</strong><div><h3>{item.label}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p></div></article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>Evidence</h2>
      <table class="evidence-table-native">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Result</th><th>Value</th><th>Contract</th><th>Boundary</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {evidenceRows.map((item) => (
            <tr>
              <td>{item.result}</td>
              <td><code>{item.value}</code></td>
              <td>{item.contract}</td>
              <td>{item.boundary}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Exclusions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>ABI8 Rust token/fixed-state core and the exact 40-symbol C wire retain host L2 GO; this does not qualify the complete production fixed-state seam.</li>
        <li>The sealed H20 record qualifies only exact source <code>6f62a23</code> on official SGLang v0.5.17, one H20, and page16 BF16 NHD eager FA3.</li>
        <li>Its 12 matched stock/manager pairs cover Qwen Full and GPT-OSS Full+SWA at B1/B4 over three epochs.</li>
        <li>All 12 pairs have exact output and request-trace equality, seeded 512-token Prefix publication and hits, final all-free drain, and zero fail-stop/quarantine counters.</li>
        <li>Every GPT-OSS Hybrid pair advances SWA retirement-certificate, reclaimed-page, and wrap counters.</li>
        <li><code>performance_go=false</code>: observed mean manager overhead is +7.37% / +11.87% for Full B1/B4 and +3.99% / +4.45% for Hybrid B1/B4.</li>
        <li>No speedup, memory-saving, or general SGLang replacement is claimed.</li>
        <li>The production request-owned fixed-state seam is host-qualified only for initial clear, forward-event propagation, and retire/clear/ACK.</li>
        <li>Same-owner replacement copy has coordinator/real-CPU-tensor host tests only; its production trigger remains pending.</li>
        <li>For fixed state, GDN, KDA, ShortConv, and linear-attention bindings, plus real CUDA/model/H20/performance qualification, remain pending.</li>
        <li>Manager and state-pool handles are separate; no cross-handle atomicity is claimed.</li>
        <li>Relocation, MLA, fixed-state, overlap, CUDA Graphs, speculation, distributed execution, and performance qualification are explicitly outside the sealed ABI8 record.</li>
        <li>The frozen ABI5-v5 H20 record remains historical and qualifies only its exact 9233c06d source closure.</li>
        <li>No same-capacity KV compression claim: historical paired page16 tensor bytes are identical.</li>
        <li>Historical ABI5-v5 performance also remains NO GO: its single B4 epoch gives +4.1932% Qwen and −5.2048% GPT-OSS manager overhead.</li>
        <li>Host compaction relocates retained logical tokens exactly; it is not numerical compression.</li>
        <li>No VMM-backed SGLang tensor or multi-GPU claim.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        The sealed ABI8 manifest, summary, and 12 pair records are in{" "}
        <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/tree/main/results/h20-sglang-v0517-abi8-full-hybrid-20260823`}>
          the ABI8 H20 Prefix evidence directory
        </a>
        . The normative levels and complete exclusions are in{" "}
        <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/blob/main/docs/capability-matrix.md`}>
          the Capability Matrix
        </a>
        . The complete result index and source hashes are in{" "}
        <a href={`${repositoryUrl}/tree/main/results`}>results/</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
